    {
      "@id": "cas:Collection",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "cas:itemType": {
        "@id": "cas:Entity"
      },
      "cas:specializes": {
        "@id": "cas:Entity"
      },
      "dcterms:title": [
        {
          "@value": "Collection",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
		{
          "@value": "<p>A CASCaRA type for elements collecting entities and relationships, for example a list of requirements or diagrams using a certain notation. It corresponds to a <a href=\"https://camunda.com/bpmn/reference/\">'Group'</a> in BPMN Diagrams.</p><p>BPMN: An arbitrary set of objects can be defined as a Group to show that they logically belong together. <small>(<i>source: <a href=\"http://www.bpmn-tool.com/en/tutorial/\">BPMN Tutorial</a></i>)</small></p>",
          "@language": "en"
		},
		{
          "@value": "<p>Ein CASCaRA-Typ für Elemente, die Entitäten und Beziehungen zusammenfassen, beispielsweise eine Liste von Anforderungen oder Diagramme einer bestimmten Notation. Sie entspricht einer <a href=\"https://camunda.com/bpmn/reference/\">'Gruppe'</a> in BPMN Diagrammen. <small>(<i>source: <a href=\"http://www.bpmn-tool.com/en/tutorial/\">BPMN Tutorial</a></i>)</small></p>",
          "@language": "de"
		},
		{
          "@value": "<p>Un type CASCaRA permettant de regrouper des entités et des relations, par exemple une liste d'exigences ou des diagrammes utilisant une notation donnée. Elle correspond à un <a href=\"https://camunda.com/bpmn/reference/\">'groupe'</a> dans les diagrammes BPMN. <small>(<i>source: <a href=\"http://www.bpmn-tool.com/en/tutorial/\">BPMN Tutoriel</a></i>)</small></p>",
          "@language": "fr"
		}
      ],
      "cas:enumeratedProperty": [
        {
          "@id": "cas:Category"
        }
      ],
      "cas:enumeratedTargetLink": []
    },
    {
